OL,10,     Fpeople cope with seemingly
OL,11,     Fnever-ending crises.
OL,12,G1300 Simon Reeve's South America
OL,13,     FThe adventurer travels to the vast
OL,14,     Fwhite salt flats of Bolivia,
OL,15,     Fthrough the world's greatest
OL,16,     Fwetlands of Brazil's Pantanal, and
OL,17,     Fon to the forested heart of
OL,18,     FParaguay.
